{"l":8306,"g":8,"b":5,"cefr":"B2","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"l","q":"Læs: 'She had no choice but to cancel the party.' Hvad betyder det?","o":["Hun valgte at holde festen.","Hun aflyste ikke festen.","Hun havde mange muligheder.","Hun var nødt til at aflyse festen."],"a":"Hun var nødt til at aflyse festen.","r":"'No choice but to' = intet andet valg end at."},
{"l":8317,"g":8,"b":5,"cefr":"B2","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"l","q":"Læs: 'The more he tried to explain, the more confused we became.' Hvad passer?","o":["Jo mere han forklarede, jo mere forvirrede blev de.","Hans forklaring hjalp.","De forstod alt.","Han forklarede ikke."],"a":"Jo mere han forklarede, jo mere forvirrede blev de.","r":"'The more ..., the more ...' = jo mere ..., jo mere ..."},
